<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Hosanna antiphon of the Palm Sunday office (Roman liturgy)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">close melodic likeness; the Greek tune may have survived among instrumentalists and was reused for it</span></li></ul></section>
